	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"コーイチの妹であるナナセ・ナナミのダイバールックが「Figure-rise Standard」で立体化！",
			"• 地球連邦軍のパイロット用ノーマルスーツを、よりスポーティにアレンジしたデザインを徹底再現！",
			"• MSの装備をモチーフにしたジャベリンやシールド、スプレーガンなど各種パーツも付属するほか、3種の表情パーツで様々な表情が差し替えで楽しめる！"
		],
		"en": [
			"Koichi's sister Nanase Nanami's diver look is now three-dimensional with the \"Figure-rise Standard\"!",
			"• A more sporty version of the normal Earth Federation pilot suit!",
			"• In addition to various parts such as javelins, seals, and spray guns based on MS equipment motifs, you can enjoy various expressions by replacing them with 3 types of expression parts!"
		]
	},
